   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3793ae62-fba2-45ed-9ca2-bf39ea8d0bd6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🧠 RAG Demo: Pinecone + Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (Qwen)\n",
    "\n",
    "A production-style **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)** pipeline that answers questions about **Victoria On Move** (a Melbourne removalist company) using:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 🗂️ **Pinecone** as the vector database (replacing Chroma)\n",
    "- 🤖 **Alibaba Cloud Model Studio Qwen** as the LLM (replacing OpenAI)\n",
    "- 🧬 **HuggingFace `all-MiniLM-L6-v2`** embeddings (local, free, 384-dim)\n",
    "- 🔗 **LangChain** for orchestration\n",
    "\n",
    "> Alibaba Cloud Model Studio exposes Qwen through an **OpenAI-compatible API**, so LangChain's `ChatOpenAI` is used only as the transport client. The **actual model provider is Alibaba Cloud Model Studio**, not OpenAI.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 📖 Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates a full RAG workflow:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Website → Documents → Chunks → Embeddings → Pinecone → Retriever → Qwen → Answer\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "It keeps the original **Victoria On Move** scenario but swaps out the storage and LLM layers.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🏗️ Architecture\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "                    ┌──────────────────────────┐\n",
    "                    │  Victoria On Move URLs   │\n",
    "                    └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
    "                                 │\n",
    "                    ┌────────────▼─────────────┐\n",
    "                    │  UnstructuredURLLoader   │\n",
    "                    └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
    "                                 │\n",
    "                    ┌────────────▼─────────────┐\n",
    "                    │ Recursive Text Splitter  │\n",
    "                    └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
    "                                 │\n",
    "                    ┌────────────▼─────────────┐\n",
    "                    │  HuggingFace Embeddings  │\n",
    "                    │  (all-MiniLM-L6-v2 · 384)│\n",
    "                    └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
    "                                 │\n",
    "                    ┌────────────▼─────────────┐\n",
    "                    │     Pinecone Index       │\n",
    "                    └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
    "                                 │\n",
    "        User Query ──► Retriever ┘\n",
    "                                 │\n",
    "                    ┌────────────▼─────────────┐\n",
    "                    │  Qwen (Model Studio)     │\n",
    "                    │  qwen-plus · temp=0.4    │\n",
    "                    └────────────┬─────────────┘\n",
    "                                 │\n",
    "                                 ▼\n",
    "                          Final Answer\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "> ⚠️ **Security:** Never hardcode API keys in the notebook. Use environment variables or a `.env` file.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b843f07b-c7c6-42be-b5a0-dace5cd0adb3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Install Required Packages\n",
    "\n",
    "Run this cell once in a fresh environment. Restart the kernel if prompted.\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "pip install python-dotenv \\\n",
    "            langchain langchain-community langchain-openai langchain-pinecone langchain-huggingface langchain-text-splitters \\\n",
    "            pinecone-client \\\n",
    "            sentence-transformers \\\n",
    "            unstructured\n",
    "```\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "be73ec10-0933-413e-835c-66d61aed425c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Imports\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "d525d159-4e2f-47c0-9bc7-fd4f04742257",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "from getpass import getpass\n",
    "\n",
    "from dotenv import load_dotenv\n",
    "\n",
    "from langchain_community.document_loaders import UnstructuredURLLoader\n",
    "from langchain_text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n",
    "\n",
    "from langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI\n",
    "from langchain_huggingface import HuggingFaceEmbeddings\n",
    "\n",
    "from pinecone import Pinecone, ServerlessSpec\n",
    "from langchain_pinecone import PineconeVectorStore\n",
    "\n",
    "from langchain_core.prompts import ChatPromptTemplate\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d94f20a6-55fb-4b47-b1a0-0414be7f7059",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Configure Alibaba Cloud Model Studio & Pinecone\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔑 Required Credentials\n",
    "\n",
    "Create a `.env` file in the project root with the following keys:\n",
    "\n",
    "```env\n",
    "DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=your_alibaba_cloud_model_studio_key\n",
    "PINECONE_API_KEY=your_pinecone_key\n",
    "HF_EMBEDDING_MODEL=sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2\n",
    "DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL=https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1\n",
    "QWEN_MODEL=qwen-plus\n",
    "PINECONE_INDEX_NAME=victoria-on-move-qwen-rag\n",
    "PINECONE_NAMESPACE=victoria-on-move\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📌 Notes\n",
    "\n",
    "- The default endpoint uses the **Singapore region** (`dashscope-intl`). Change it if your workspace is in another region.\n",
    "- The embedding model here is **`sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2`** (384 dims). If you prefer **Qwen `text-embedding-v4`** (1024 dims), see the alternate block in Section 6.\n",
    "- The Pinecone index dimension **must match** the embedding dimension.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1528a442-40d5-4830-85c9-b7c25f37c2d2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "load_dotenv()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Prompt for keys only if they are missing from the environment.\n",
    "if not os.getenv(\"DASHSCOPE_API_KEY\"):\n",
    "    os.environ[\"DASHSCOPE_API_KEY\"] = getpass(\"Enter Alibaba Cloud Model Studio API key: \")\n",
    "\n",
    "if not os.getenv(\"PINECONE_API_KEY\"):\n",
    "    os.environ[\"PINECONE_API_KEY\"] = getpass(\"Enter Pinecone API key: \")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Alibaba Cloud Model Studio OpenAI-compatible endpoint (Singapore by default).\n",
    "DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL = os.getenv(\n",
    "    \"DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL\",\n",
    "    \"https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Qwen text-generation model\n",
    "QWEN_MODEL = os.getenv(\"QWEN_MODEL\", \"qwen-plus\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# HuggingFace embedding model (local, free)\n",
    "HF_EMBEDDING_MODEL = os.getenv(\n",
    "    \"HF_EMBEDDING_MODEL\",\n",
    "    \"sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "EMBEDDING_DIMENSION = 384  # all-MiniLM-L6-v2 output dimension\n",
    "\n",
    "# Pinecone settings\n",
    "PINECONE_INDEX_NAME = os.getenv(\"PINECONE_INDEX_NAME\", \"victoria-on-move-qwen-rag\")\n",
    "PINECONE_NAMESPACE = os.getenv(\"PINECONE_NAMESPACE\", \"victoria-on-move\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Qwen model:\", QWEN_MODEL)\n",
    "print(\"Embedding model:\", HF_EMBEDDING_MODEL)\n",
    "print(\"Embedding dimension:\", EMBEDDING_DIMENSION)\n",
    "print(\"Pinecone index:\", PINECONE_INDEX_NAME)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4e5eb0d6-eaa8-43b0-a7fd-a4b007ad58d6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Load Live Website Data\n",
    "\n",
    "We scrape the official **Victoria On Move** website pages using `UnstructuredURLLoader`.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5adb6574-848a-4047-9051-7f07dbe5cc18",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "urls = [\n",
    "    \"https://www.victoriaonmove.com.au/local-removalists.html\",\n",
    "    \"https://victoriaonmove.com.au/index.html\",\n",
    "    \"https://victoriaonmove.com.au/contact.html\",\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "loader = UnstructuredURLLoader(urls=urls)\n",
    "data = loader.load()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Loaded documents:\", len(data))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "30721f32-e706-438a-8f17-710af7d0cd7f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Quick sanity check: inspect the first document\n",
    "data[0]\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7beac744-393e-420c-aefc-eb4e11807ead",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Split Documents into Chunks\n",
    "\n",
    "We use `RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter` with `chunk_size=1000` and `chunk_overlap=150` to preserve context across chunk boundaries.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "fdcdf729-2bb5-4af1-8249-f43ab31028cd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "text_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n",
    "    chunk_size=1000,\n",
    "    chunk_overlap=150\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "docs = text_splitter.split_documents(data)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Total number of chunks:\", len(docs))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "19a2e6a7-138a-43bf-85cd-9e3f75db7dcd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "docs[0]\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0791ab2f-4fdd-4f99-b679-aecd271ca1fe",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Create Embeddings\n",
    "\n",
    "### Option A (default in this notebook): HuggingFace `all-MiniLM-L6-v2`\n",
    "- ✅ Free, local, no API key\n",
    "- ✅ 384 dimensions\n",
    "- ✅ Great for small-to-medium RAG projects\n",
    "\n",
    "### Option B: Alibaba Cloud `text-embedding-v4` (Qwen3-Embedding series)\n",
    "- Requires `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY`\n",
    "- 1024 dimensions (must update Pinecone index dimension to `1024`)\n",
    "- Higher quality for multilingual / large corpora\n",
    "\n",
    "We use **Option A** below. Uncomment the Option B block if you prefer Qwen embeddings.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "aca66bc1-006e-4ff2-a2df-3d54261dd53e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ---------- Option A: HuggingFace embeddings (default) ----------\n",
    "embeddings = HuggingFaceEmbeddings(\n",
    "    model_name=HF_EMBEDDING_MODEL,\n",
    "    model_kwargs={\"device\": \"cpu\"},\n",
    "    encode_kwargs={\"normalize_embeddings\": True},\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "test_embedding = embeddings.embed_query(\n",
    "    \"What services does Victoria on Move provide?\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "print(\"Embedding vector length:\", len(test_embedding))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "b0b7e1c1-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ---------- Option B: Alibaba Cloud text-embedding-v4 (uncomment to use) ----------\n",
    "# from langchain_openai import OpenAIEmbeddings\n",
    "#\n",
    "# embeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings(\n",
    "#     model=\"text-embedding-v4\",\n",
    "#     api_key=os.environ[\"DASHSCOPE_API_KEY\"],\n",
    "#     base_url=DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL,\n",
    "#     dimensions=1024,\n",
    "# )\n",
    "# EMBEDDING_DIMENSION = 1024  # must match Pinecone index\n",
    "# print(\"Embedding vector length:\", len(embeddings.embed_query(\"test\")))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cf91442f-b3ec-4848-bdc4-8de1da1a2fe8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Create / Connect to Pinecone Index\n",
    "\n",
    "The Pinecone index dimension **must match** the embedding dimension (`384` for HuggingFace, `1024` for Qwen `text-embedding-v4`).\n",
    "\n",
    "> ⚠️ If an index with the same name already exists but with a different dimension, either:\n",
    "> - Use a new index name, or\n",
    "> - Delete and recreate the old index in Pinecone.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c244b31e-be3f-4f0e-8f25-c896ca3308c3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "pc = Pinecone(api_key=os.environ[\"PINECONE_API_KEY\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "if not pc.has_index(PINECONE_INDEX_NAME):\n",
    "    pc.create_index(\n",
    "        name=PINECONE_INDEX_NAME,\n",
    "        dimension=EMBEDDING_DIMENSION,\n",
    "        metric=\"cosine\",\n",
    "        spec=ServerlessSpec(cloud=\"aws\", region=\"us-east-1\"),\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    print(\"Created Pinecone index:\", PINECONE_INDEX_NAME)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"Using existing Pinecone index:\", PINECONE_INDEX_NAME)\n",
    "\n",
    "index = pc.Index(PINECONE_INDEX_NAME)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e49a4766-d7a8-47f5-9f3a-8a42b171510e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Store Document Chunks in Pinecone\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c98a94f9-6144-417e-9e34-007affb9dfa5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "vectorstore = PineconeVectorStore(\n",
    "    index=index,\n",
    "    embedding=embeddings,\n",
    "    namespace=PINECONE_NAMESPACE,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "vectorstore.add_documents(\n",
    "    documents=docs,\n",
    "    namespace=PINECONE_NAMESPACE,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Documents successfully stored in Pinecone.\")\n",
    "print(\"Namespace:\", PINECONE_NAMESPACE)\n",
    "print(\"Number of chunks:\", len(docs))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "832fa5d0-ad92-4353-8483-bd7694580502",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 9. Create the Retriever\n",
    "\n",
    "The retriever fetches the **top-k** most similar chunks from Pinecone for a given query.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "54328a1c-6b92-4832-8658-18f6ed78e04e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "retriever = vectorstore.as_retriever(\n",
    "    search_type=\"similarity\",\n",
    "    search_kwargs={\"k\": 3},\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "retrieved_docs = retriever.invoke(\n",
    "    \"What kind of services do Victoria on Move provide?\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Retrieved documents:\", len(retrieved_docs))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "282c5597-a0ed-46cc-9535-ba6c3bb5aa22",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(retrieved_docs[0].page_content)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "805d279b-7820-4dc9-bcae-91c89fa8cf0b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 10. Connect Qwen from Alibaba Cloud Model Studio\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🧠 How Qwen is Used\n",
    "\n",
    "Alibaba Cloud Model Studio exposes Qwen through an **OpenAI-compatible API**. LangChain's `ChatOpenAI` is used as the **transport client** — but the **actual model provider is Alibaba Cloud Model Studio**.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Parameter | Value | Purpose |\n",
    "|-----------|-------|---------|\n",
    "| `model` | `qwen-plus` | Qwen text-generation model |\n",
    "| `api_key` | `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` | Authenticates with Model Studio |\n",
    "| `base_url` | `dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/...` | Model Studio endpoint |\n",
    "| `temperature` | `0.4` | Balance between factual & natural |\n",
    "| `max_tokens` | `500` | Cap response length |\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🎯 Role in the RAG Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "Qwen acts as the **final reasoning engine**:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Receives the user's question + retrieved context\n",
    "2. Generates a grounded, concise answer\n",
    "3. Refuses to answer if the context doesn't contain the answer\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔄 Why OpenAI-Compatible?\n",
    "\n",
    "Model Studio's OpenAI-compatible mode means **no custom SDK required** — any OpenAI-compatible tool (LangChain, LlamaIndex, etc.) works out of the box. Just change the `base_url` and `api_key`.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "500b6fe3-01f1-4965-9a24-76e23ac66452",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "llm = ChatOpenAI(\n",
    "    model=QWEN_MODEL,\n",
    "    api_key=os.environ[\"DASHSCOPE_API_KEY\"],\n",
    "    base_url=DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL,\n",
    "    temperature=0.4,\n",
    "    max_tokens=500,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Sanity check: direct Qwen call\n",
    "qwen_test = llm.invoke(\"In one sentence, what is RAG?\")\n",
    "print(qwen_test.content)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "05b422b3-42b5-4bfe-86cf-7a02a20b951f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 11. Build the RAG Chain\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔗 RAG Flow\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Retrieve** — Fetch top-k relevant chunks from Pinecone\n",
    "2. **Format** — Concatenate chunks into a single `context` string\n",
    "3. **Prompt** — Inject `context` + user question into the prompt\n",
    "4. **Generate** — Send prompt to Qwen, receive grounded answer\n",
    "5. **Return** — Output the answer to the user\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "46c6c4ca-b263-4750-b4c8-12a15b6148c5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# --------------------------------------------------\n",
    "# RAG System Prompt\n",
    "# --------------------------------------------------\n",
    "system_prompt = (\n",
    "    \"You are an assistant for question-answering tasks. \"\n",
    "    \"Use the following retrieved context to answer the question. \"\n",
    "    \"If the answer is not present in the context, say that you do not know. \"\n",
    "    \"Do not invent information. \"\n",
    "    \"Keep the answer concise, with a maximum of three sentences.\"\n",
    "    \"\\n\\n\"\n",
    "    \"Retrieved context:\\n{context}\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages(\n",
    "    [\n",
    "        (\"system\", system_prompt),\n",
    "        (\"human\", \"{input}\"),\n",
    "    ]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# --------------------------------------------------\n",
    "# Helper: Combine retrieved documents into context\n",
    "# --------------------------------------------------\n",
    "def format_docs(docs):\n",
    "    return \"\\n\\n\".join(doc.page_content for doc in docs)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# --------------------------------------------------\n",
    "# RAG Chain Function\n",
    "# --------------------------------------------------\n",
    "def rag_chain(question):\n",
    "    # 1. Retrieve relevant documents from Pinecone\n",
    "    retrieved_docs = retriever.invoke(question)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # 2. Convert documents into a single context string\n",
    "    context = format_docs(retrieved_docs)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # 3. Send question + context to Qwen\n",
    "    response = llm.invoke(\n",
    "        prompt.format_messages(context=context, input=question)\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "    # 4. Return the answer\n",
    "    return response.content\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# --------------------------------------------------\n",
    "# Test the RAG system\n",
    "# --------------------------------------------------\n",
    "question = \"What kind of services do they provide?\"\n",
    "answer = rag_chain(question)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Question:\")\n",
    "print(question)\n",
    "print(\"\\nAnswer:\")\n",
    "print(answer)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e982b42c-c1d4-4bd8-8940-954a25b953e4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 12. Ask a Question\n",
    "\n",
    "The complete RAG flow is now live:\n",
    "\n",
    "**Website → Documents → Chunks → Embeddings → Pinecone → Retriever → Context → Qwen → Answer**\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "630ece35-c144-47b0-b196-1df2efe7928f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "question = \"What kind of services do Victoria on Move provide?\"\n",
    "answer = rag_chain(question)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Question:\")\n",
    "print(question)\n",
    "print(\"\\nAnswer:\")\n",
    "print(answer)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
