    "## 🏗️ RAG Architecture Used in This Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "| Layer | Technology |\n",
    "|-------|------------|\n",
    "| **Data Source** | Victoria On Move website |\n",
    "| **Loader** | `UnstructuredURLLoader` |\n",
    "| **Chunking** | `RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter` (1000/150) |\n",
    "| **Embeddings** | HuggingFace `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` (384d) |\n",
    "| **Vector DB** | **Pinecone** (serverless, cosine) |\n",
    "| **Retriever** | Pinecone similarity search (top-k=3) |\n",
    "| **LLM** | **Alibaba Cloud Model Studio Qwen** (`qwen-plus`) |\n",
    "| **Generation** | Qwen answers using retrieved context |\n",
    "\n",
    "This keeps the original notebook scenario while replacing the **OpenAI/Chroma** components with **Alibaba Cloud Model Studio Qwen** and **Pinecone**.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🔧 Configuration Reference\n",
    "\n",
    "| Parameter | Location | Default | Purpose |\n",
    "|-----------|----------|---------|---------|\n",
    "| `chunk_size` | `RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter` | `1000` | Text chunk length |\n",
    "| `chunk_overlap` | `RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter` | `150` | Overlap between chunks |\n",
    "| `k` | `retriever` | `3` | Number of docs retrieved |\n",
    "| `search_type` | `retriever` | `similarity` | Retrieval strategy |\n",
    "| `temperature` | `ChatOpenAI` | `0.4` | Response randomness |\n",
    "| `max_tokens` | `ChatOpenAI` | `500` | Max output length |\n",
    "| `metric` | Pinecone index | `cosine` | Distance metric |\n",
    "| `cloud` / `region` | Pinecone index | `aws` / `us-east-1` | Serverless spec |\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🛡️ Guardrails\n",
    "\n",
    "The assistant is designed to **never hallucinate**:\n",
    "\n",
    "- ✅ Answers **only** from retrieved context\n",
    "- ✅ Says **\"I do not know\"** if the answer is missing\n",
    "- ✅ Never invents information\n",
    "- ✅ Keeps answers **concise** (max 3 sentences)\n",
